{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2023-08", "window": 2, "start_date": 1691452800, "end_date": 1692143999, "month_true_total": 125, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:22:21 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "144294194", "author": {"steamid": "76561198023229931", "personaname": "Shatsu Aka", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198023229931/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 9178, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2174, "last_played": 1784429671, "avatar": "311c5448f305b1162b0d3a08713ee1f1a2c448de"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you like Left 4 Dead and the Aliens series, this is a good game to play with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1692138635, "timestamp_updated": 1692138635, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144247880", "author": {"steamid": "76561198358601648", "personaname": "박신혜", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198358601648/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 52589, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14588, "last_played": 1781263412, "avatar": "2c919c16b20859fed322e4c6855353e98177a080"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very nice game. But it's only 3 player abit sad for this. Hopefully they make update for 4-5player", "timestamp_created": 1692093713, "timestamp_updated": 1692093803, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.589411795139312744", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144245634", "author": {"steamid": "76561197978027296", "personaname": "Oscar the Corgi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197978027296/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 6983, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6983, "last_played": 1691923187, "avatar": "45666f92ee26d23f37a93fad2fed2fcd5e3a7d24"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is 'okay'. \nIt's not great, it's not terrible. I enjoyed the time I had with it. Much better with friends.  For a reasonably new dev, the game was fun. \nSome weird and odd design choices - I didn't like that it's 3 player. There is no communication in the game at all other than pings and emotes - weird for a co-op game. Not alot of maps - it gets repetitive. \n\nThe end game is in a rough spot. Not enough players to always guarantee a game.  There are clear 'meta' classes and builds which limits what little replayability the game has. \n\nWhilst I still recommend the game for Alien fans - it's one to pick up if interested whilst on sale.", "timestamp_created": 1692091016, "timestamp_updated": 1692091016, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144233294", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960429467", "personaname": "Muzzy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197960429467/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 82235, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 389, "playtime_at_review": 16666, "deck_playtime_at_review": 10737, "last_played": 1788386223, "avatar": "3f100993d4e076abacc7c40f032db2eb402fda36"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is still my favorite game. I have played all the new horde shooters, and I keep coming back and playing this one. Killing xenos is just so satisfying. It scratches that theorycrafting itch really hard.\n\nThe difficulty curve is high and the skill ceiling is higher. It's so much fun just taking on difficult challenges and playing with other people on Discord.", "timestamp_created": 1692075138, "timestamp_updated": 1718913388, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.535484790802001953", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144136038", "author": {"steamid": "76561198150156166", "personaname": "Synister_6", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198150156166/", "num_games_owned": 138, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 1223, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 627, "last_played": 1692511857, "avatar": "acf67207768cdc5be5f09aca6a9f7830bf27d6f7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Love this game, Love the Alien Movies, so this was a easy buy!!", "timestamp_created": 1691973077, "timestamp_updated": 1691973077, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}